    <rel_range>19:15</rel_range>
    <field_description order="before"><para>Describes the minimum number of INTID.ID bits which requires a level 2 ISTE size of 16 bytes to store metadata.</para>
<para>When the configured number of INTID.ID bits is smaller than ISTMD_SZ, the minimum required size of a level 2 ISTE is 8 bytes.</para>
<para>When the configured number of INTID.ID bits is larger than or equal to ISTMD_SZ, the minimum required size of a level 2 ISTE is 16 bytes.</para></field_description>
