    <field_description order="before"><para>Whether the IST entries contain metadata storage.</para>
<para>When the IST entries contain metadata storage, the size of a level 2 ISTE is 8 bytes or 16 bytes.</para>
<para>The size of an IST entry containing metadata depends on the configured ID range and the values reported in ISTMD_SZ.</para></field_description>
    <field_values impdef="False">
      <field_value_instance>
